    "title": "Four players ejected after Thunder vs Wizards bench-clearing skirmish",
    "text": "Four players ejected after Thunder vs Wizards bench-clearing skirmishWASHINGTON — A bench-clearing skirmish resulted in the ejection of four players during the OKC Thunder's road game against the Washington Wizards on Saturday.Following a bucket by Anthony Gill with 27 seconds left until halftime, Justin Champagnie and Jaylin Williams got into it underneath the basket. Ajay Mitchell then interjected and was shoved in the face by Champagnie, leading to both teams running onto the court.AdvertisementChampagnie, Mitchell, Williams and Cason Wallace were all ejected. OKC (55-15) has a 69-64 lead over Washington (16-53) at halftime.This article will be updated.LIVE UPDATES: Thunder vs Wizards live updates: Shai Gilgeous-Alexander, OKC visit Alex Sarr, Washington1 / 9Thunder-Wizards fight spills into stands during OKC road NBA gameWASHINGTON, DC - MARCH 21: Ajay Mitchell #25 of the Oklahoma City Thunder is pulled out of a scrum of players by teammate Shai Gilgeous-Alexander #2 against the Washington Wizards during the first half at Capital One Arena on March 21, 2026 in Washington, DC. Ajay Mitchell #25 of the Oklahoma City Thunder received a double technical and ejected from the contest.2 / 9Thunder-Wizards fight spills into stands during OKC road NBA gameWASHINGTON, DC - MARCH 21: Justin Champagnie #9 of the Washington Wizards walks to the bench before receiving a double technical against the Oklahoma City Thunder during the first half at Capital One Arena on March 21, 2026 in Washington, DC. Both Justin Champagnie #9 of the Washington Wizards and Ajay Mitchell #25 of the Oklahoma City Thunder received double technicals were ejected from the contest.9 / 9Thunder-Wizards fight spills into stands during OKC road NBA gameWASHINGTON, DC - MARCH 21: Shai Gilgeous-Alexander #2 of the Oklahoma City Thunder shoots the ball against the Washington Wizards during the first half at Capital One Arena on March 21, 2026 in Washington, DC.Justin Martinez covers the Thunder and NBA for The Oklahoman. Have a story idea for Justin? He can be reached at jmartinez@oklahoman.com or on X/Twitter at @Justintohoops. Sign up for the Thunder Sports Minute newsletter to access more NBA coverage. Support Justin's work and that of other Oklahoman journalists by purchasing a digital subscription today at subscribe.oklahoman.com.This article originally appeared on Oklahoman: Thunder-Wizards skirmish leads to four players getting ejected",
